step Fishing 1-50: Elwynn Forest
  when zone "Elwynn Forest"
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip If you don't know Brilliant Smallfish yet, the arrow first takes you to its nearest seller. Fish a quiet lake south of Goldshire until Fishing 50 and cook what you catch as you go until Cooking 50: about 59% of catches are Raw Brilliant Smallfish, so cook Brilliant Smallfish. Place a Basic Campfire Kit beside the water (one every 5 minutes) and empty your bags into the fire; any fish recipe you know counts toward the Cooking target. The Raw Brilliant Smallfish line counts the fish you still need for Cooking 50 (about 50 from Cooking 1) and drops as your Cooking rises; once your bags hold that many, stop fishing and cook. That is roughly 90 casts here, about 30 minutes.
  learn 7751 nearest
  skill Fishing 50
  collect 6291 x50 anywhere optional
  craft 7751 until 50
  goto 47.61,62.32 "Crystal Lake" r 25 optional

