step Fishing 125-150: Redridge Mountains
  when zone "Redridge Mountains"
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip If you don't know Bristle Whisker Catfish yet, the arrow first takes you to its nearest seller. Fish the lake at Lakeshire until Fishing 150 and cook what you catch as you go until Cooking 150: about 63% of catches are Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish, so cook Bristle Whisker Catfish. Place a Basic Campfire Kit beside the water (one every 5 minutes) and empty your bags into the fire; any fish recipe you know counts toward the Cooking target. The Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish line counts the fish you still need for Cooking 150 (about 42 from Cooking 110) and drops as your Cooking rises; once your bags hold that many, stop fishing and cook. That is roughly 70 casts here, about 20 minutes. Save 2g for Fishing 150: the Expert Fishing book and the Expert Cookbook cost 1g each.
  learn 7755 nearest
  skill Fishing 150
  collect 6308 x42 anywhere optional
  craft 7755 until 150
  goto 21.9,51.13 live "Lake Everstill" r 25 optional

