# ---- Fishing 150-175, Cooking 150-175

step Expert Fishing
  when !knows 7732
  tip Expert Fishing is a book, not a trainer rank, and lifts the cap to 225. Expert Fishing - The Bass and You is sold only by Old Man Heming on the docks of Booty Bay, for 1g. Buy it and read it. It needs character level 20.
  level 20
  money 1g
  train Fishing Expert

step Expert Cooking
  when !knows 3413
  tip The Expert Cookbook lifts Cooking to 225. It has its own sellers, 1g each; the arrow picks the nearest. Buy it and read it. It needs character level 20.
  level 20
  money 1g
  train Cooking Expert
  buy 6530 x5 nearest optional

