  when zone "Stormwind City"
  when !knows 20916
  tip Recipe: Mithril Headed Trout is an item a vendor sells, usually the fishing supplier. The arrow points at the nearest seller: buy it, then right-click it in your bags to learn it.
  buy 17062 x1 nearest
  learn 20916

step Fishing 175-225: to Dustwallow Marsh
  when zone "Stormwind City"
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip The nearest good water for this range from Stormwind City is Dustwallow Marsh: the north coast of the marsh, away from Theramore Isle. Fly to Menethil Harbor and take the boat to Theramore. About 58% of catches there are Raw Mithril Head Trout. Any of Alterac Mountains, Stranglethorn Vale, Arathi Highlands works too: go there instead and the guide follows you. Save about 3g 20s for Fishing 225: the Spotted Yellowtail and Filet of Redgill recipes cost 1g 60s each, plus the Alterac Swiss for the Artisan Cooking quest.
  learn 20916 nearest
  skill Fishing 225
  collect 8365 x52 anywhere optional
  craft 20916 until 225
  goto 58.7,17.2 "North coast" r 25 optional

