  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Keep going at any of Dustwallow Marsh, Alterac Mountains, Stranglethorn Vale, Arathi Highlands; the arrow points at Dustwallow Marsh. Save about 3g 20s for Fishing 225: the Spotted Yellowtail and Filet of Redgill recipes cost 1g 60s each, plus the Alterac Swiss for the Artisan Cooking quest.
