step Fishing 225-300: to Azshara
  when zone "Dustwallow Marsh"
  zone Azshara
  tip The nearest good water for this range from Dustwallow Marsh is Azshara: the east coast. About 35% of catches there are Raw Redgill. Tanaris works too: go there instead and the guide follows you.
  learn 18241 nearest
  skill Fishing 300
  collect 13758 x120 anywhere optional
  craft 18241 until 300
  goto 51.6,53.6 "Azshara coast" r 25 optional

